{# xfce4-panel.xml.j2

   Captured from administrator@dvgs-testmachine on 2026-05-06 as the
   canonical Sudhanix-26 top panel layout. The single substitution is the
   lotus icon path, which differs only in deployment location
   (/usr/share/icons/cttb/lotus.png) from where the admin authored it
   (~/Downloads/lotus.png).

   Plugin layout (left-to-right):
     34 separator         start spacer
      1 applicationsmenu  lotus icon + apps
     25 appmenu           global application menu (compact-mode false, bold)
      5 separator         expanding (pushes everything right of it)
      2 actions           "Log Off" button
      6 systray           Zoom, Fcitx, nm-applet
     31 pulseaudio        volume + mpris
     10 separator
     33 notification-plugin
     13 separator
     12 clock             custom 24h "%a %d %b  %H:%M"
      9 separator
#}
